The Quest Nemesis for Rogue is one of the weaker ones; I wouldn't
worry at all about your equipment.

It _is_ possible that the Master Assassin will be generated near the
stairs - it happened to me once - but I wouldn't try my luck.

Your best bet is to use the Castle wand to wish for a ring of poly
control and a wand of poly.  The latter will be very useful for the
whole game, so it's not much of a wasted wish.

Alternately, you could collect a bunch of junk rings, just wish for
the wand of poly, and hope you get lucky by poly-ing all the junk
rings.

